text.section:
Whoever assumes the custody of a living infant of unknown parentage shall report on a form and in the manner prescribed by the Board within seven days to the registrar of the county or city in which such child was found, the following information:

The date and place of finding;


Sex, race and approximate birth date of such child;


Name and address of the persons or institution with whom such child has been placed for care;


Name given to such child by the custodian of the child; and


Such other data as may be required by the Board.
